  "headline": "God of War Ragnarok early walkthrough (Missions 1-4): skill priorities, gear roles, and a no-stall route",
  "description": "A stability-first plan for The Path missions 1-4: choose a defense style, lock short runics, and keep upgrades on pace so early fights do not spike in difficulty.",
  "keywords": [
    "god of war ragnarok early game",
    "gow ragnarok mission 1 2 3 4",
    "best skills early",
    "best armor early",
    "beginner tips"
  ],
  "articleBody": "Scope: The Path missions 1-4. The goal is to prevent the most common early wall: falling behind on upgrades and defensive consistency.\n\n1) Decide your baseline (this prevents most early deaths)\n- Defense style: mostly parry or mostly evade; invest into the shield tree that matches\n- Runics: lock two short, landable options (avoid long animations)\n- Gear: pick by role, not by name (stability vs exploration)\n\n2) Route notes\n- On each new area: find the shop and open shortcuts\n- Mission 3: crowd pressure rises, so build Blades control early\n- Mission 4: if you feel stuck, treat it as an upgrade timing problem first\n\n3) Early skill priorities\n- Shield: strengthen your chosen defense loop\n- Blades: short AoE and control options for multi-target fights\n- Axe: low-commitment, consistent hits over long strings\n\n4) Early gear roles\n- Stability set: mitigation/sustain plus short runics\n- Exploration set: cooldown leaning for more frequent runic windows\n\nRelated: use the hub to jump to the full story chart and chapter build timeline.",
